.TH UBUNTU-PASSKEY 1 "October 2026" "ubuntu-passkey 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ubuntu\-passkey \- manage the passkeys stored by Ubuntu Passkey
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ubuntu\-passkey
[\fB\-\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ubuntu\-passkey
opens Passkeys, a graphical application to list, inspect and delete the
passkeys stored on this computer, view the status of the
.BR passkeyd (1)
service, and change its settings.
.PP
The service also runs this program with an internal
.B \-\-prompt
option to ask for approval when the GNOME Shell extension is not active.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR passkeyd (1)
